{"source": "wacg51", "article_key": "277062", "url": "https://51cg1.com/archives/277062/", "title": "抖音百万网红 刘大炮 出轨奶露拖 抛弃糟糠之妻 酒店开房视频被公之于众！ 热搜 HOT", "published_at": "2026-09-28", "html": "<div class=\"post-content\" itemprop=\"articleBody\">\n\n<div class=\"line\" style=\"margin-top: 0\"></div>\n<p>抖音百万网红刘大炮。本名刘天宇，河南那个抽象老哥，早年拍情侣日常，B站还整过抽象两口子，后面靠大云（烟）系列起飞！出轨的对象叫奶露拖，本名刘诗琪，重庆永川妹子，抖音千万网红。清纯脸抽象嘴，缺颗门牙也能玩出天际，清冷氛围感往那一站像校园初恋，一张嘴又是抽象女。俩人直播PK互喊永远的敌人、不共戴天，私下却偷情开房！</p><p><img alt=\"1\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-02f8a05700d8.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"2\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-e5032b50071d.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"3\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-06087e1c7e41.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"4\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-e44d2cc57a5d.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"5\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-1ee48b9e4268.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"6\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-33ad7f88151e.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"8\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-eeaaa7a47aec.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"9\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-200e1218bd1b.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"12\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-5de0450e996b.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"14\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-e7c784718291.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"15\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-ef28216c5ad1.jpg\"/></p><h2>永远的敌人还是永远的情人</h2><p>PK现场俩人嘴上骂得凶，啥老子跟你不共戴天之类的。更炸的是，奶露拖直播把炮哥微信直接整出来！炮哥号上还能看到尊师奶露拖这类挂件！开房视频一出来，整活两个字就有点撑不住了。到底是抽象营业，还是抽象遮羞，你们自己品。</p><p><img alt=\"27\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-bd065e858d78.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"28\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-98bbc9cb9a01.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"29\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-a29b72308970.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"30\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-7858cf08c037.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"31\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-7c824552ca90.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"32\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-303d6d1f7327.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"33\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-8bf4bcbc00a4.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"34\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-24c82d9ffa66.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"35\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-feafc5f8ab2d.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"36\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-a64fdc55defe.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"37\" src=\"wacg51/277062/img-bd946351e173.jpg\"/></p><h2>拜完大云记得评一评</h2><p>号上拜神，外头开房，正宫挂着，敌人锁死。大云之神眷顾善良的孩子，可不眷顾装瞎的粉丝。酒店视频已经在流传，微信也亮过，改头像改背景那些惩罚更像情侣之间的小游戏。信人设的接着磕，不信的该醒也醒了。</p> \n\n\n\n<!-- 热闻区 -->\n\n<!-- 官方公告 -->\n\n</div>", "images": [{"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010475970231.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-02f8a05700d8.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010480185247.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-e5032b50071d.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010480376164.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-06087e1c7e41.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010480728125.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-e44d2cc57a5d.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010480922493.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-1ee48b9e4268.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010481017362.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-33ad7f88151e.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010481123361.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-eeaaa7a47aec.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010481349011.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-200e1218bd1b.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010481598988.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-5de0450e996b.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010481777246.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-e7c784718291.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010481935331.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-ef28216c5ad1.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010482890307.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-bd065e858d78.jpg"}, {"source_url": "https://pic.ndhixj.cn/upload_01/xiao/20260930/2026093010482973302.jpeg", "key": "wacg51/277062/img-98bbc9cb9a01.jpg"}, {"so